{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2023-05-23 09:38:00', 'title': "AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL WELCOMES TEAM OF WOMEN ADVISORS WHO WERE “BLOWN AWAY” BY THE FIRM'S SUPPORTIVE, CLIENT-FIRST CULTURE", 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FINANCIAL ADVISORS LAUREN SALAS, CFP®, AND JAN KLEIN RECENTLY JOINED THE BRANCH CHANNEL OF AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP) FROM MORGAN STANLEY WITH $154 MILLION IN ASSETS. THE TEAM WAS ATTRACTED TO THE FIRM'S STRONG REPUTATION FOR FOSTERING A SUPPORTIVE COMMUNITY AND CLIENT-FIRST CULTURE. SALAS AND KLEIN ARE JOINED BY REGISTERED CLIENT SERVICE ASSOCIATE ASHLEY LEOPOLD, AMERIPRISE COMPLEX DIRECTOR DANIEL LANDRAU AND AMERIPRISE ASSOCIATE BRANCH MANAGER ROSS CA."}